{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend The Cubes at all costs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend The Cubes is a unique tower defense game that replaces static towers with deployable units that fight to protect your cube. Each wave of enemies brings new challenges, pushing you to think carefully about where and when to place your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With enemies circling the cube along dynamic paths, no two battles ever feel the same. It\u2019s all about planning, adapting, and outsmarting your foes before they can break through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Unit Deployment</strong> \u2013 Position and manage units to counter ever-changing enemy waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Pathing</strong> \u2013 Enemies move along shifting paths around the cube, keeping battles unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible but Deep</strong> \u2013 Easy to learn, yet packed with strategic depth for tower defense fans.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome, Hero!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3485160/9f33804a9067a642be3966a33c0a784c1299e22b.jpg"},{"name":"A New Journey Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3485160/695aebf64c3d18f0acdc9394a64db5740b79c928.jpg"},{"name":"The Hero\u2019s Progress","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3485160/83148c49430bcef50c8ae63b8ca90e5131f68fb7.jpg"},{"name":"Unleash the Pain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3485160/10ec55906da34fd23420c46eb271038e0d157d96.jpg"},{"name":"Bringer of Destruction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3485160/46f5674394fd9abfba2d551c94f17785ef44eb08.jpg"},{"name":"Sh